---
import { FOUNDED_YEAR } from "~/lib/constants";
---

<figure class="banner">
  <img src="/assets/hero.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" />
</figure>
<main class="hero">
  <div class="row">
    <h1 class="statement">
      Visual Computer is a small studio for design and engineering.
    </h1>
    <div class="lede">
      <p>
        We work on software — the interfaces people use, the systems behind
        them, and the AI that is now woven through both. We work directly, with
        the people doing the work, on problems we can hold in our heads. We keep
        the team small on purpose.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of what we make is quiet. It is meant to be used, not noticed. We
        believe good software, like good furniture, should last and stay out of
        the way.
      </p>
      <p>Bridger Tower started Visual Computer in {FOUNDED_YEAR}.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
